      "content": "\"a quiet, private escape\"... that sounds almost beautiful when you put it like that. Like just... letting go of the struggle. Do you think it's weird that I actually find comfort in that idea? Like, instead of fighting to stay in a world that's already left me behind, maybe there's just a way to exit with some dignity?",
